# 📚 Book Writer Framework

## 🎯 Project Overview

**Advanced Book Writer** - A comprehensive writing application with AI assistance, voice dictation, and Scrivener-like organization features for creating professional-quality books.

### Core Mission
Enable writers to create 100-page novels (25,000-30,000 words) using a combination of manual writing, voice dictation, and AI assistance.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture Framework

### Frontend Stack
```
React 18 + TypeScript
├── Next.js 14 (App Router)
├── Tailwind CSS (Styling)
├── Zustand (State Management)
├── Web Speech API (Voice Recognition)
└── File-saver (Export Functionality)
```

### AI Integration
```
Ollama (Local AI)
├── llama3.1 (Primary Model)
├── Python Backend (ollama_book_generator.py)
├── TypeScript Frontend (ollamaAI.ts)
└── REST API Integration
```

### File Structure
```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── BookWriter/          # Core writing components
│   ├── Chapters/            # Chapter management
│   ├── AI/                  # AI assistants and tools
│   ├── Layout/              # UI layouts
│   └── ui/                  # Reusable components
├── store/                   # State management
├── utils/                   # Utility functions
└── app/                     # Next.js pages and API
```

