## 🎤 Voice Dictation Framework

### Implementation
```typescript
// Voice recognition setup
const recognition = new window.webkitSpeechRecognition();
recognition.continuous = true;
recognition.onresult = (e) => {
  const transcript = e.results[e.results.length - 1][0].transcript;
  setBuffer(prev => prev + transcript + '\n');
};
```

### Best Practices
- **Clear Speech**: Speak at moderate pace
- **Punctuation**: Use "period", "comma", "new paragraph"
- **Review**: Check buffer before adding to chapter
- **Control**: Use Start/Stop buttons for precise control

